text FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CantBecomeGoodTrainerWithOneMon {
    "You can't become a good TRAINER\n"
    "with just one strong POKéMON.\p"
    "But raising many POKéMON evenly\n"
    "is no easy task, either.$"
}

text FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokemonLeagueWestOfViridian {
    "There's a narrow trail west of\n"
    "VIRIDIAN CITY.\p"
    "It goes to the POKéMON LEAGUE HQ.\n"
    "The HQ governs all TRAINERS.$"
}

text FuchsiaCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_VisitSafariZoneForPokedex {
    "If you're working on a POKéDEX,\n"
    "visit the SAFARI ZONE.\p"
    "All sorts of rare POKéMON breed\n"
    "there.$"
}
